      "difficulty_reason": "The weight-one divisibility proof combines Artin-Selmer torsion and control, Hida families, absence of pseudonull submodules, smoothness of the eigencurve, Artin approximation and limiting Kato divisibilities. The rational divisibility and conditional full equality remain exactly as stated. Introductory simplifications of the Hida coefficient ring are not treated as hypotheses of the final theorem.",
